17. IPFS REMOTE KNOWLEDGE DRIVE
==================================================

IPFS provides a content-addressed remote
storage backend for GammaThink.

IPFS is not a conventional mutable hard drive.

GammaThink implements remote-drive behaviour
through a virtual filesystem, manifests,
on-demand block retrieval and local caching.

